175	    <section class="section">
176	      <h2 class="section-title">Live token values</h2>
177	      <p class="section-desc">Read at runtime from the public <code>design-system.css</code> via
178	      <code>getComputedStyle</code> — these reflect the <em>currently active</em> mode and can't drift from the
179	      stylesheet. Contrast is text-on-background, computed in the browser (target 4.5:1 AA).</p>
180	
181	      <table class="token-table">
182	        <thead>
183	          <tr><th>State</th><th>Background</th><th>Border</th><th>Text / icon</th><th>Contrast</th></tr>
184	        </thead>
185	        <tbody id="token-rows"><!-- populated at runtime --></tbody>
186	      </table>
187	
188	      <p class="callout"><strong>Why this can't go stale.</strong> Nothing here hardcodes a hex value — the swatches,
189	      the codes, and the contrast ratios are all derived from the live <code>--arxiv-</code> status tokens. Change a token
190	      in <code>design-system.css</code> and this table updates on the next reload. If the stylesheet ever fails to load,
191	      the page visibly breaks, so it doubles as a smoke test.</p>
192	    </section>
193	
194	    <section class="section">
195	      <h2 class="section-title">Usage</h2>
196	      <p class="section-desc">Variants: <code>ds-alert-success</code>, <code>ds-alert-info</code>,
197	      <code>ds-alert-warning</code>, <code>ds-alert-error</code>. Use <code>role="status"</code> for success/info
198	      (polite) and <code>role="alert"</code> for warning/error (assertive); icons carry <code>aria-hidden="true"</code>.</p>
199	
200	      <pre class="code-block">&lt;div class="ds-alert ds-alert-info" role="status"&gt;
201	  &lt;svg class="ds-alert-icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;!-- icon --&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
202	  &lt;div class="ds-alert-content"&gt;
203	    &lt;p class="ds-alert-title"&gt;Viewing an older version&lt;/p&gt;
204	    &lt;p&gt;A newer version exists — &lt;a href="..."&gt;see the latest&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
205	  &lt;/div&gt;
206	&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
207	
208	      <p class="callout"><strong>Deferred.</strong> An action-button slot (Retry / Undo) and a transient toast variant
209	      are not part of this component yet — see the internal <code>DESIGN-PROGRESS.md</code>.</p>
210	    </section>
