174	    <h1>Link Styles</h1>
175	    <p>The canonical <code>.ds-link</code> utility class for inline text links on public-facing pages.
176	    Four interactive states (default, hover, visited, focus) driven by the
177	    <code>--arxiv-link-blue</code> / <code>--arxiv-link-hover</code> / <code>--arxiv-link-visited</code>
178	    tokens, with dark-mode overrides scoped to <code>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)</code>.
179	    DESIGN-POLICIES.md: inline body links must be underlined; standalone nav links may omit it.</p>
