185	  <section class="section">
186	    <h2 class="section-title">The four states</h2>
187	    <p class="section-desc">Default is Link Blue with a 2px-offset underline. Hover deepens the color
188	    (no underline thickness change — kept subtle to avoid layout shift). Visited shifts to Visited
189	    Purple. Focus shows the 3px Link Blue ring via <code>:focus-visible</code>.</p>
