337	         .ds-alert-error; quiet .callout is for neutral usage notes only). -->
338	    <div class="ds-alert ds-alert-error note-alert">
339	      <svg class="ds-alert-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m15 9-6 6"/><path d="m9 9 6 6"/></svg>
