342	        <p>Color contrast against body text is only 3.0:1 in light mode — too marginal to rely on alone.
343	        Underlines are mandatory for inline links per DESIGN-POLICIES.md and WCAG 1.4.1 (use of color).
344	        Standalone navigation links (header, footer, button-like surfaces) may omit the underline.</p>
