371	
372	    <p class="callout"><strong>Scoped base rule.</strong> Apply the same styling to every <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>
373	    inside a content surface (article, paragraph block) without per-anchor classes.</p>
374	    <pre style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e0dbd7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--arxiv-font-mono); font-size: 12px; overflow-x: auto;"><code style="background: none; padding: 0;">.article-body a {
