/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SITE FOOTER  (.ds-site-footer)
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   The universal arXiv public-page footer. Design approved 2026-06-11,
   validated in three places that agree almost exactly: the approved
   spinout-header-footer Cloud Run deployment, mockups/abstract-redesign.html,
   and mockups/html-redesign.html (see audits/2026-06-11/AUDIT-COMPONENTS.md
   addendum — "the most validated component on this list").

   Structure (three pieces):
     1. Acknowledgment line — "We gratefully acknowledge support from our
        **major funders**, **member institutions**, and all contributors."
